{"headword":"שֹׁד²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"(v. infr.) <strong>n.m. violence, havoc, devastation, ruin</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:13\" href=\"/Hosea.7.13\">Ho 7:13</a> +; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.4\">Is 22:4</a> +;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>violence, havoc</em>, as social sin: <span dir=\"rtl\">חָמָס וָשֹׁד</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 3:10\" href=\"/Amos.3.10\">Am 3:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.7\">Je 6:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.8\">20:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.9\">Ez 45:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ וְח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:3\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.3\">Hb 1:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּזָב וָשׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:2\" href=\"/Hosea.12.2\">Ho 12:2</a> (l. <span dir=\"rtl\">וָשָׁוְא</span>, 𝔊 We Marti al.), <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ יָשֶׁבֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.7\">Is 59:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.18\">60:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.2\">Pr 24:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עָמָל</span>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ רְשָׁעִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.7\">Pr 21:7</a>; c. genit. obj. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ עֲנִיִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 12:6\" href=\"/Psalms.12.6\">ψ 12:6</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>devastation, ruin</em>, for nation <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:13\" href=\"/Hosea.7.13\">Ho 7:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּשֹׁד מִשַּׁדַּי יָבוֹא</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.6\">Is 13:6</a> (sim. of <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם י׳</span>) = <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:15\" href=\"/Joel.1.15\">Jo 1:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.4\">Is 16:4</a>; (Lo Gr Che<sup>Hpt</sup> Marti <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁדֵד</span>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹמֵס</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.4\">22:4